  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Found amidst the ruins of a razed record store, \"Starchild\" (formerly known as Derek) was forever changed the night Subchain City suffered its great quake. Now corrupted, he wanders the wastes seeking a new flock to find meaning beyond DRIP and destruction.",
    "class": "Bruiser",
    "name": "Starchild",
    "personality": "Haunted: Starchild is constantly reliving the quake that took his family, giving him an edge in combat due to his heightened awareness and trauma. Reckless: Starchild has no regard for his own safety. Loyal: Starchild values the few friends he has found in Subchain City, willing to go the distance for those he trusts.",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "Starchild channels the pent-up quack-rage from Subchain City's quake through his Crow-Killer. For one turn, his melee attacks deal 3x damage and inflict the 'Ouchy' debuff, but his defense is reduced by 50% due to reckless abandon. Representing the Ouchy debuff he deals, targets feel his pain.",
